# The private layer (docs/PRIVATE-LAYER.md): personal-use rules, its own repo.
private/
# Python caches from the tools (tools/data, tools/gff).
__pycache__/
# Art made from the game's files, built at build time, never committed (the owner, 2026-11-17: "go with 1, remove the
# six files from main"; CLAUDE.md: "Game files (and art made from them), logs and saves are never committed or
# attached"). build.bat makes them into the build's data\files with tools/data/build_derived.js (tools/data/README.md);
# the generators' own runs (the VFX Bench's Save and build) still write them here, and they stay here, ignored.
# The Floating Disk's models: the six of the game's placeable meshes, and c_n5fd_empty.mdl - its disk mesh is
# original, but it carries c_invsguy's node names and positions, which its supermodel needs (the owner, 2026-11-17:
# "go with your recs for the three questions"):
/data/files/c_n5fd_empty.mdl
/data/files/c_n5fd_small.mdl
/data/files/c_n5fd_med.mdl
/data/files/c_n5fd_large.mdl
/data/files/plc_n5fd_small.mdl
/data/files/plc_n5fd_med.mdl
/data/files/plc_n5fd_large.mdl
# A Composer placeable's model, plc_n5<name>[_<k>].mdl, built from the game's parts. Its .pwk (a use point and an
# outline) stays committable, as do the disk's .pwk files and n5t_forcedisk.tga, made from scratch:
/data/files/plc_n5*.mdl
# A dyed part's baked texture, n5p_<hash>, made from the game's PLT and palettes:
/data/files/n5p_*
# A Composer shape's soft texture, n5s_<hash>: original, but build output like a bake - its bytes a pure function of
# the recipe's colour, rebuilt for every build (tools/data/build_derived.js); committing them would pile up stale ones
# while colours are explored:
/data/files/n5s_*
# A moving texture's material, n5u_<hash>.mtr (M2: its texture, motion and pivot) - build output as a soft texture is -
# and, on the copy route, the texture copied under its name (from the game's, for a library texture). The shader they
# name, vsn5uvmove.shd, is ours and committed (tools/data/floatdisk/made.txt lists it):
/data/files/n5u_*
# A library texture's copy without its decal mark (DC: a still shape's, n5l_<hash>.tga / .dds / .txi) - the game's art,
# copied from the player's own game at build time, so never committed:
/data/files/n5l_*
# One burst (LD; tools/data/oneburst.js): the game's 16 placeable models whose looping "dead" re-fires a detonate, built
# from the player's own game without it and served under their own names - the game's models, so never committed:
/data/files/plc_c03.mdl
/data/files/plc_c04.mdl
/data/files/plc_c10.mdl
/data/files/plc_h10.mdl
/data/files/plc_i02.mdl
/data/files/plc_k02.mdl
/data/files/plc_q03.mdl
/data/files/plc_x0_fgs.mdl
/data/files/plc_x0_grw.mdl
/data/files/plc_x0_tds.mdl
/data/files/plc_x0_wds.mdl
/data/files/pwc_mage_001.mdl
/data/files/px2_b04.mdl
/data/files/px2_c10.mdl
/data/files/px2_e01.mdl
/data/files/px2_g02.mdl
# The particle mask's shader (#184's spike; tools/data/particle_mask.js): the game's fsparticle.shd with nwn5e's mask
# added, built from the player's own game - the game's shader text, so never committed:
/data/files/fsn5pmask.shd
